  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Webinar on “How to Crack TCS Drive”</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">ATME College of Engineering is celebrating its decennial year, on account of this Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering is organizing Webinar on “<strong>How to Crack TCS Drive</strong>”</p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Date</strong>: 24<sup>th</sup> July 2021</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Time</strong>: 3.15 PM to 4.15 PM</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Who can enroll?</strong> : Pre-Final year students.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Meeting Platform: </strong>Microsoft Teams</p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Chief Patrons</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Mr. Arun Kumar L</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Chairman, ATMECE, Mysore</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Mr. Shivashankar K</strong>\nSecretary, ATMECE, Mysore</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Mr. Veeresh R</strong>\nTreasurer, ATMECE, Mysore</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dr. Basavaraj L</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Principal, ATMECE, Mysore</p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Convener</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dr. Mahesh P K</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">HOD, Dept. of Electronics and Communication</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">ATMECE, Mysore</p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Resource Person</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Madhuri H N</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Associate System Engineer</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>TCS</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bangalore.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>(2019 Batch Alumni)</strong></p>\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Faculty Placement Coordinators:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Guruprasad K N</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Assistant Professor, Dept. of ECE</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">ATMECE</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Keerthi A Kumbar</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Assistant Professor, Dept. of ECE</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">ATMECE</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
